---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Mark from '../components/Mark.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Base title="Find your rhythm — Special" description="Feel the difference between calm, playful and snappy spring motion. Tune stiffness and damping, then copy a sampled CSS easing for your own project.">
<section class="container page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">THE MOTION PLAYGROUND</span><h1>Small movement.<br/><em>Big feeling.</em></h1><div class="page-intro-bottom"><p>A spring has a personality.<br/>Find the one that fits your interface.</p><span class="eyebrow">TUNE IT. FEEL IT. TAKE IT.</span></div></section>
<section class="container playground-layout" data-spring-workbench><div class="spring-stage"><div class="spring-stage-top"><span class="eyebrow">A SPRING, IN ITS ELEMENT.</span><span>MASS 1 / LIVE PREVIEW</span></div><div class="spring-stage-track" data-spring-track><div class="spring-stage-object" data-spring-object><Mark size={45}/></div><div class="spring-stage-target">＋</div></div><div class="spring-stage-bottom"><p data-spring-status>Ready when you are.</p><button data-spring-replay>Replay <span>↻</span></button></div></div><div class="spring-controls"><span class="eyebrow">GIVE IT SOME CHARACTER</span><div class="spring-control"><label for="stiffness">Stiffness <output for="stiffness" id="stiffness-value">380</output></label><input id="stiffness" type="range" min="80" max="900" value="380" step="10"/><p>The pull toward the destination. More stiffness, more urgency.</p></div><div class="spring-control"><label for="damping">Damping ratio <output for="damping" id="damping-value">0.80</output></label><input id="damping" type="range" min="0.35" max="1.2" value="0.8" step="0.05"/><p>The amount of bounce. Lower damping, more playfulness.</p></div><div class="motion-presets" aria-label="Spring presets"><button data-spring-preset="calm" aria-pressed="true">Calm</button><button data-spring-preset="playful" aria-pressed="false">Playful</button><button data-spring-preset="snappy" aria-pressed="false">Snappy</button></div></div><div class="spring-code"><div><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SOMETHING TO TAKE WITH YOU</span><h2>Your spring. In CSS.</h2><p>Copy a sampled spring curve using CSS <code>linear()</code>. It’s an approximation of this mass-1 spring, ready to try on a transform.</p><p>Your device’s reduced-motion preference always wins. Movement becomes an instant state change; the values remain available to explore.</p></div><div class="code-block"><span>CSS · SAMPLED SPRING</span><pre><code data-spring-code></code></pre><button data-copy-spring aria-label="Copy spring CSS"><Icon name="copy" size={17}/></button></div></div></section>
</Base>
